

A: Changes made to 12-01-95 bam tigre code to incorporate GL 
	Serial/Modem code

	
	1) Replace Modem.?pp with Serial.?pp

		- Remove Modem.obj from tigre.mak

		- Add Serial.obj to tigre.mak

		- replace include of "modem.hpp" with include of "serial.hpp"
		  in file "comm.hpp"

	1.5) Use new MEM.CPP (which removes "no track mem" error check)

	2) Remove all Magna Carta headers

		del ascii.h
		del cctdef.h
		del cctlimit.h
		del ccttype.h
		del comm.h
		del compat.h
		del ins8250.h
		del keys.h
		del mc.h
		del modem.h
		del rawtypes.h
		del wc386.h


	3) Add Green Leaf headers

		asciidef.h 
		compat20.h
		cppcomp.h
		ibmkeys.h
		tw.h
		video.h
		_defs386.h
		_dwdisp.h 

		compplib.hpp
		comdef.hpp
		nasi.hpp
		_8250.hpp
		_comlink.hpp
		_dosisr.hpp
		_star.hpp
	
	4) replace Magna Carta lib with Greenleaf lib in Bam.mak
		
		LIB = tigre.lib, sosdw1pr, sosmw1pr, netnowr.lib, cctew95r.lib
	   is now
		LIB = tigre.lib, sosdw1pr, sosmw1pr, netnowr.lib, cpfr32.lib
		
		del cctew95r.lib


	5) replace your old "mainmenu.cpp" with jc's version of "mainmenu.cpp"



B: Other changes to Tigre
	
	1) Replace ClipRect with TClipRect
	2) Replace File::Length() with File::Size()
	3) Delete obsolete files....
		OSGRPH.CPP

